    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Dokumentarni film \u201eStepinac - Kardinal i njegova savjest\u201c pri\u010da je o \u017eivotu Alojzija Stepinca, o tome kako se kao \u010dovjek i zagreba\u010dki nadbiskup nosio s najve\u0107im izazovima 20. stolje\u0107a, o globalnom i univerzalnom zna\u010daju njegova djela, o korijenu kontroverzi koje ga prate do dana\u0161njih dana, o relevantnosti njegova primjera i univerzalnosti njegovih poruka u dana\u0161njem vremenu. To je ujedno i pri\u010da o hrvatskoj i europskoj povijesti 20. stolje\u0107a, kao neizostavnom kontekstu djelovanja.",
        "english": "The documentary film \"Stepinac - The Cardinal and His Conscience\" is a story about the life of Alojzije Stepinac, about how he, as a man and the Archbishop of Zagreb, dealt with the greatest challenges of the 20th century, about the global and universal significance of his work, about the roots of the controversies that have followed him to this day, about the relevance of his example and the universality of his messages in today's time. It is also a story about Croatian and European history of the 20th century, as an indispensable context for his work."
